5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm Yumi. Let's have a great game together!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hi... I'm Daisuke. I hope we can find the truth.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Asuka here. I will analyze the logic carefully.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us be kind.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi everyone! I'm Midori. I love cooking, maybe I'll make dinner later!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Midori, that sounds delicious! I'm sure we'll all get along well.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It's nice to meet you all.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Socializing is irrelevant. Focus on the roles. Who is the Seer?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Asuka, be gentle. We are all friends here.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm just a villager, I think. I'll listen to everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"Asuka, don't be so harsh. We need to trust each other first.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,Yumi is right. Trust is important. I feel a bit nervous.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Trust is a variable. I will observe your behavior for inconsistencies.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Daisuke, take a deep breath. You are doing fine.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I feel calm. Let's just see what happens tonight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we have a peaceful night.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
