35,1,1,talk,Midori,,Good morning! I'm ready to help. What did you find?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I checked on Daisuke last night. I can confirm he is human.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Oh... really? I... I didn't expect that. Thank you.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Interesting. So Yumi is likely the Seer. Daisuke is safe.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is wonderful news, Yumi. We can trust Daisuke now.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
