46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Midori, don't be scared. We will figure this out together.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. We should vote for the one who seems suspicious.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
